=== Normal Response ===
Veyra Sunhallow is a fictional character from the fantasy novel series "The Wheel of Time" by Robert Jordan. She is a member of the Aiel people, a race of nomadic warriors from the desert region of the world known as the Aiel Waste. Veyra is a Wise One, a title given to the spiritual leaders of the Aiel. She is known for her wisdom, strength, and her ability to channel the One Power, a magical energy that can be harnessed by certain individuals in the series. Veyra plays a significant role in the events of the series, particularly in the final books.

